    {
      "clause_type": "subprocessors",
      "rationale": "General discretion to appoint sub-processors, notice only after the change takes effect, and a blanket waiver of objection rights conflict with Article 28(2) and 28(3)(d) GDPR, which require prior specific or general written authorisation and a genuine opportunity to object.",
